# The assessment of MODEL-ROUTE-013 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# MODEL-ROUTE-013: "Routing selectors shall address the exact model-assisted judgment
# implementation or logical operation, not only the owning RulePackage. A RulePackage may
# independently route mechanical implementations, lightweight agent reviews, high-authority
# reviews, explanations, corrections, and other registered implementations without
# conflating their authority or evidence class."
#
# First sentence: `RuleSelector` already selects at exactly that finer grain -- it matches
# `RuleId` (one check), never a package -- a real, tested precedent for "not only the owning
# package," though nothing it selects is model-assisted (every registered rule is
# mechanical).
#
# Second sentence: the two distinctness vocabularies this needs are real and tested:
# `EvidenceClass` (ordered so combination can never manufacture strength) for "evidence
# class," and `AuthorityClass` (deliberately un-ordered so one class cannot be mistaken for a
# stronger version of another) for "authority." `RulePackage` itself, the addressee the
# requirement names, is declared ("normative rules, their judgments, corrections and
# fixtures") and now has a manifest type and a JSON reader (`nomos-rule-package`, `OD-
# PACKAGE-008`) -- no longer among the kinds `PackageKind`'s own doc comment calls "genuinely
# unconsumed." But nothing outside that one crate calls the reader: there is still no
# registration mechanism for multiple,
# differently-authorized implementations filed under one rule or package, and no selector
# operates at that per-implementation granularity -- `RuleSelector`'s grain is "which
# RuleId," one implementation per rule, today.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/policy/rule_selector.rs#RuleSelector
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding/evidence_class.rs#EvidenceClass
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/authority.rs#AuthorityClass
gap: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/package_kind.rs#RulePackage
